<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh exchanges closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh exchanges closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dhaka and Chittagong stock exchanges were closed on Tuesday for the New Year holiday.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index closed 38.67 points up at 2,300.14 on Monday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
